                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A true old school scroller with some new school mechanics.\n\nYou know when you play an old school game and you think \"jeez I'm going to kill my buttons playing this\" or \"ah I wish I could have this ability sooner so I can enjoy it\" well the dev seems to have spent many years pondering a many of these and made a genuinely fun game.\n\nI like to run it in a small window while I'm watching something and play but then get captured by the intensity and next thing I know I've made it to level four and since that takes some serious skill you just can't put it down. \n\nCannot recommend this enough and it's so cheap off the bat.",
